text.section:
Application of proceeds. A secured party shall apply or pay over for application the cash proceeds of disposition under § 8.9A-610 in the following order to:

the reasonable expenses of retaking, holding, preparing for disposition, processing, and disposing, and, to the extent provided for by agreement and not prohibited by law, reasonable attorney's fees and legal expenses incurred by the secured party;


the satisfaction of obligations secured by the security interest or agricultural lien under which the disposition is made;


the satisfaction of obligations secured by any subordinate security interest in or other subordinate lien on the collateral if:
